work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xSXTRvUz9KsQ7kNvwHx7XdD&_nc_oc=Adoh5jzF0_QoSl3OoPbxSwl9vGLzxHguDGjgnhWsPiQJnKgpiOpoqkpyCk9_1nfDcg8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af25t0Am8z3ZHOQsFyR-zRzJkLZILteXFsYqabOPUFnJVg&oe=69F0C2F3"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jYdqCasZ6FEQ7k